# M03 Progress:

## State Machine Navigation:
### For debugging purposes, you are able to go to all three stages from the start screen right now.
- START: takes you through a normal run-through of the game, starting with instructions and opening sequence
- A Button: takes you to the jungle stage
- B Button: takes you to the boss stage
- SELECT: takes you to the cave stage


## Finished:
- Have 4 unique sprites (player, boss, npc, sword, alert, and fireballs);
- 2 animated sprites (player and boss)
- 2 independent scrolling bgs (parallax in cave stage)
- Modified palette at runtime (animated colors in WIN and LOSE states)
- state machine in general
- Looping and not looping sound (analog sound plays when you take dmg in boss fight)
- Imported text tiles and functions for tilemap modification (used in dialogue)

## Next steps:
